.CloseupTitleCard a:hover,
.CloseupTitleCard a:active {
  color: #444;
}</style><div class="CloseupTitleCard" data-test-id="closeup-title-card"><div class="ADXRXN"><div data-test-id="rich-pin-information"><div data-test-id="pin-title-wrapper" itemprop="name"><a class="etmDmh i7jpet DodKMr KQwCbH Q3hcOU y1OnKm zlD4hU O0u6sV" href="https://www.etsy.com/listing/1810364834/wix-template-for-hotel-resort-or?utm_source=Pinterest&amp;utm_medium=organic" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"><h1 class="wyEmcc qnEc35 WuRgKB inh4_C yv4JQN iuUxZ9">Wix template for hotel - resort or homestay websites, modern and luxury web design, website template</h1></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ADXRXN eOQXgz" style="height: 100%;"><div class="ADXRXN" style="padding-right: 0px; margin-top: 2px; width: 100%;"><div class="ADXRXN C6J6UC i1hWBD"><div class="H2DtUH J6fL34 GJN9iM Tjcf3c"><div class="oRZ5_s wl0pCr" style="flex-basis: 0px;"><div class="ADXRXN" style="padding-right: 0px; width: 100%;"><div data-test-id="visit-site-button" class="ADXRXN"><a class="etmDmh i7jpet zlD4hU Q3hcOU O0u6sV RLsYhV G0yGFD ap8aAM j0pMjI hG7AI5 itmoZr" href="https://www.etsy.com/listing/1810364834/wix-template-for-hotel-resort-or?utm_source=Pinterest&amp;utm_medium=organic" rel="nofollow" tabindex="0"><div class="WuRgKB eMU5i5 o5UlW_ hL1e7w">Visit site</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="H2DtUH KwViV7 FE_3R1 KDGhSV _tKaHB drGcEU qtP9fl wl0pCr" style="min-height: 0px;"><div data-test-id="product-description" class="ADXRXN i1hWBD"><div data-test-id="product-description-preview" class="ADXRXN DTsIgD"><h4 class="wyEmcc qnEc35 WuRgKB GLAOFg yv4JQN iuUxZ9">Description</h4><div class="ADXRXN eOQXgz gEQpi5"><div class="ADXRXN" style="display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; transition: height 200ms ease-in-out 0s;"><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN iHQedX"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">VIEW DEMO HERE:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">https://bithemer.wixstudio.io/larita</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">(Attention! The Demo contains the latest updates of the template.)</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">TEMPLATE DESCRIPTION</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">Larita is a custom Wix template designed for websites in the hospitality industry, such as hotels, resorts, and homestays. The Larita template features a luxurious, elegant, and sophisticated design, leaving a lasting impression on users. It is optimized for devices ranging from desktops to mobiles, ensuring an exceptional user experience.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">The Larita template includes all the essential pages needed for hospitality websites, such as Home, Rooms &amp; Suites, Hotel Story (About), Spa &amp; Wellness, Restaurant &amp; Bar, Meetings &amp; Events, News &amp; Offers, Booking, and Contact. Each page has a unique design that highlights specific content, making hotel or resort websites stand out.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">Built on Wix Studio, Larita has a scientifically organized structure of components and features, ensuring flexibility and ease of customization across various devices. Additionally, the template utilizes Wix Studio's built-in CMS tools, making it simple and convenient for content administrators to edit and manage content.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">YOU CAN:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Customize the template’s pages.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Add custom pages.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Customize the logo, images, and page content.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Adjust theme colors and component colors.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Edit and delete anything on the page.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">TEMPLATE INCLUDES:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Homepage</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- About (hotel story) page</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Rooms &amp; Suites page (Rooms or Suites, Room details)</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Restaurant &amp; Bar page</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Spa &amp; Wellness page</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Meets &amp; Events page</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- News &amp; Offers page (News or Offer, Post details)</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Contact page</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- Reservation page.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">REQUIRED ENVIRONMENT:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">Wix Studio (you need a Wix account).</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">USAGE INSTRUCTIONS:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">Unzip the downloaded zip file and read the instructions in the file Instructions.txt.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">TERMS AND CONDITIONS:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- When you purchase this template, services like adding, modifying template features, or editing source code are not included.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- This template is specifically for Wix Studio. Please ensure to purchase it for the correct environment to avoid any confusion.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">- This is a download-and-use template; therefore, refund or return policies do not apply. Please make sure you need this Wix template before purchasing.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">LICENSE:</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">With each license, you can use this template to create one or multiple websites, and these websites can be used by you. You can sell the websites created from this template to a client of yours. You are not allowed to resell this template under any circumstances.</span></span></div><div data-test-id="structured-description" class="ADXRXN eOQXgz"><span class="dvEf_b aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j"><span class="pA9X1U aMgNKE YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 hxKTA7 mm0O_j">If you have any questions regarding the Larita template, please feel free to contact me. I am always available and ready to assist you.</span></span></div></div></div><div class="H2DtUH KwViV7 FE_3R1 Tjcf3c xdjfP5"><div aria-disabled="false" class="Q3hcOU DodKMr O0u6sV llGzT4 hlFz_k be_g_n ap8aAM" data-test-id="product-description-expand-cta" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="WuRgKB e1bAMf YfEt3H v_eFe4 qnEc35 eLtWQB B3NXeR N6RR6H">See more</div></div></div></div></div><div class="ADXRXN"><div data-testid="closeup-